#. <CLT 4>時計で時間を知ったところで…
#. なんか虚しくなるだけだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sure, I can look at the clock and see what \"time\" it\n"
"is. But what's the point?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この教室にも鉄板か…
#. 悲しい事に、なんか見慣れてきたな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Another room sealed up with metal plates. It's kinda\n"
"sad I'm actually getting used to it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

